  "instance_name": "meme_connotation",
  "label": "Meme Connotation",
  "description": "The meme conveys a tone of casual confidence or ominous foreboding, implying that the person is about to initiate a disruptive, reckless, or potentially negative event. This connotation relies on cultural understanding of internet humor, where juxtaposing a serious-looking person with casual, ominous text creates a humorous or dramatic effect. The 'mmmm hmmmmmmm' at the bottom reinforces the idea of someone contemplating or deciding on a course of action with a sense of inevitability or satisfaction.",
